flowchart TD
    A[User drags a handle] --> B[Handle position written to world-space state]
    B --> C{Shared proximity check:<br/>is a required element within range?}
    C -->|No| D[Per-handle visual warning shown]
    C -->|Yes| E[No visual warning]
    B --> F[Group pass/fail evaluator re-runs]
    F --> G{All rules pass,<br/>including proximity check?}
    G -->|No| H[Group renders as failing]
    H --> I[Failure dialog available,<br/>listing every applicable reason]
    G -->|Yes| J[Group renders as passing]

    K[Element predates this feature:<br/>handle fields absent] --> L[Exempt from proximity check entirely]
    L --> F
